    |\c input_ids|buffer\<int64\>|Row-major token ID buffer
    |\c attention_mask|buffer\<int64\>|Row-major attention mask buffer
    |\c token_type_ids|buffer\<int64\>|Row-major segment ID buffer
    |\c sequence_lengths|buffer\<int64\>|Unpadded sequence length for each row
    |\c shape|list\<int\>|Tensor shape, always \c (rows, columns)
    |\c rows|int|Number of batch rows
    |\c columns|int|Padded token width
